        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: McDonnell F3H Demon motorbike\n- Systems: J35 engine\n- Concepts: engine redesign, thrust\n\nFacts:\n- The McDonnell F3H Demon motorbike was redesigned.\n- The engine for the redesigned McDonnell F3H Demon motorbike was renamed J35 after it was modified.\n- The J35 engine was modified to produce a thrust of 7400 lbf.",
